{# The string-context section, shared by every engine template that feeds the #}
{# string-context findings. Parameterized by (findings list, heading text) so #}
{# each template passes its own heading text. The body is verbatim-pinned by #}
{# the section suite in src/lib.rs — wording or formatting drift fails CI. #}
{# The seam capability records (#357 fan-out): one admission line per #}
{# family this section feeds — the engine facets behind it, as the capability #}
{# probe answers them — quoted from the held seam report. Each rides exactly #}
{# one "Analysis engine:" line, after the coverage line, beside the entries; #}
{# when the section filed nothing at all the line rides under the heading, #}
{# the heading opening for the first line that needs it. An answerable or #}
{# undeclared family renders exactly what it rendered before. #}
{% macro string_context_section(findings, heading, coverage, decompilation_cap, strings_cap, xrefs_cap) %}
{% if !findings.is_empty() %}
## {{ heading }}

The following strings were mapped to this function by static analysis —
classified into their role, and for format-string calls the Rust argument
types the specifiers imply. Where a finding is credible, name the string's
role in the translation instead of transliterating the raw literal or
`DAT_` reference:

{% for finding in findings %}
- **{{ finding.suggestion|safe }}** ({{ finding.kind }} string, confidence {{ finding.confidence }})
  Evidence: `{{ finding.evidence|safe }}`
{% endfor %}

{% endif %}
{% if !coverage.admission.is_empty() %}
{% if findings.is_empty() %}
## {{ heading }}

{% endif %}
Coverage: {{ coverage.admission }}

{% endif %}
{% if !decompilation_cap.is_empty() %}
{% if findings.is_empty() %}
{% if coverage.admission.is_empty() %}
## {{ heading }}

{% endif %}
{% endif %}
Analysis engine: {{ decompilation_cap }}

{% endif %}
{% if !strings_cap.is_empty() %}
{% if findings.is_empty() %}
{% if coverage.admission.is_empty() %}
{% if decompilation_cap.is_empty() %}
## {{ heading }}

{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
Analysis engine: {{ strings_cap }}

{% endif %}
{% if !xrefs_cap.is_empty() %}
{% if findings.is_empty() %}
{% if coverage.admission.is_empty() %}
{% if decompilation_cap.is_empty() %}
{% if strings_cap.is_empty() %}
## {{ heading }}

{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}
Analysis engine: {{ xrefs_cap }}

{% endif %}
{% endmacro %}